2163
01:31:44.581 --> 01:31:46.319
Crazy, the (crosstalk drowns out speaker).

2164
01:31:46.319 --> 01:31:48.346
And then we start talking and talking.

2165
01:31:48.346 --> 01:31:52.245
And then because I was at the time the deputy minister,

2166
01:31:52.245 --> 01:31:55.306
I had this white car, with driver and security.

2167
01:31:55.306 --> 01:31:58.406
I offered to drive them to their hotel,

2168
01:31:58.406 --> 01:32:00.619
