and then we dated in Afghanistan with our bodyguard.

2174
01:32:10.101 --> 01:32:11.400
I gotta say this part.

2175
01:32:11.400 --> 01:32:12.356
Oh, that is it.

2176
01:32:12.356 --> 01:32:14.023
The ministry of interior had given us a bodyguard,

2177
01:32:14.023 --> 01:32:17.688
because I was threatening people but just my beliefs.

2178
01:32:17.688 --> 01:32:19.855
And the bodyguard was WAT,

2179
01:32:20.829 --> 01:32:24.826
