2180
01:32:24.826 --> 01:32:26.994
And he had this liniest...

2181
01:32:26.994 --> 01:32:27.827
(laughs)

2182
01:32:27.827 --> 01:32:29.101
You know how soldiers have this bullets here?

2183
01:32:29.101 --> 01:32:32.857
He had a line of marijuana or hashish

2184
01:32:32.857 --> 01:32:34.232
roll up here, right there.

2185
01:32:34.232 --> 01:32:36.051
I'm like, "You're a police officer.

2186
01:32:36.051 --> 01:32:37.126
You're a cop."

2187
01:32:37.126 --> 01:32:38.594
But he actually was a teacher.

2188
01:32:38.594 --> 01:32:41.082
He was a teacher from Badakhshan.

2189
01:32:41.082 --> 01:32:42.773
And we used to call him (speaking in foreign language)

2190
01:32:42.773 --> 01:32:45.224
