2191
01:32:45.224 --> 01:32:48.792
And he was forced to work in the army as a bodyguard,

2192
01:32:48.792 --> 01:32:50.282
because he couldn't make enough money.

2193
01:32:50.282 --> 01:32:52.487
So he was our chaperone.

2194
01:32:52.487 --> 01:32:55.396
And when we would go to a hotels or to restaurants,

2195
01:32:55.396 --> 01:32:58.359
to have dinner, he would actually follow us.

2196
01:32:58.359 --> 01:33:00.430
He would fall asleep all the time.

2197
01:33:00.430 --> 01:33:03.329
(crosstalk drowns out speaker)

2198
01:33:03.329 --> 01:33:05.362
Bodyguard with the kind (indistinct).

2199
01:33:05.362 --> 01:33:06.392
There were times when Dean had to carry

2200
01:33:06.392 --> 01:33:07.922
(indistinct) to the car.

2201
01:33:07.922 --> 01:33:10.971
Let's go, it's time to go home.

2202
01:33:10.971 --> 01:33:12.051
And he would wake up.

2203
01:33:12.051 --> 01:33:13.712
And just-
So that's how we met.

