01:33:23.745 --> 01:33:26.202
but this all feels very predestined to me.

2209
01:33:26.202 --> 01:33:27.035
It does.

2210
01:33:27.035 --> 01:33:27.943
The work that you're doing now

2211
01:33:27.943 --> 01:33:30.695
