2216
01:33:40.733 --> 01:33:42.612
Us being neurologists,

2217
01:33:42.612 --> 01:33:45.823
and talking about flex and tangles in Alzheimer's disease,

2218
01:33:45.823 --> 01:33:47.564
and being involved in all the science,

2219
01:33:47.564 --> 01:33:50.716
and putting a halt to that not necessarily a halt,

2220
01:33:50.716 --> 01:33:55.613
