2225
01:34:04.809 --> 01:34:06.342
The work we do even now,

2226
01:34:06.342 --> 01:34:11.107
it's not the esoteric clinical trials and stuff.

2227
01:34:11.107 --> 01:34:12.683
We are, I think the only neurologists,

2228
01:34:12.683 --> 01:34:14.172
that work in the communities.
That's right.

2229
01:34:14.172 --> 01:34:16.020
We lead one of the largest brain health initiatives

2230
01:34:16.020 --> 01:34:16.853
