2231
01:34:16.853 --> 01:34:17.981
With the focus on women.

2232
01:34:17.981 --> 01:34:19.574
They're centered on women.

2233
01:34:19.574 --> 01:34:20.572
So, meaning that

2234
01:34:20.572 --> 01:34:22.329
we actually take the women in the community.

2235
01:34:22.329 --> 01:34:23.162
We train them,

2236
01:34:23.162 --> 01:34:25.311
'cause we know that they're going to have the most impact,

2237
01:34:25.311 --> 01:34:26.760
and coming back to that.

2238
01:34:26.760 --> 01:34:29.829
And they're the most successful by far.

2239
01:34:29.829 --> 01:34:34.230
As far as destiny, well, it depends on the searching mind,

