2250
01:34:58.311 --> 01:35:01.656
and especially the women who are given freedom,

2251
01:35:01.656 --> 01:35:03.320
and look what they can do.

2252
01:35:03.320 --> 01:35:04.274
I wonder as neurologists,

2253
01:35:04.274 --> 01:35:07.434
if you saw also some of the fallout on the other side,

2254
01:35:07.434 --> 01:35:12.201
where this kind of being forced to shroud stay inside,

2255
01:35:12.201 --> 01:35:15.951
